# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course explores the tools being used in the pursuit of quantum advantage, including quantum error suppression, mitigation, detection, and correction. Each method is explained in theory, and then put into practice using Qiskit. We discuss which method is useful in which scenarios, as well as general trends in applicability. As the course progresses, we pay particular attention to which tools can be leveraged together, and which conflict.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini meneroka alat-alat yang digunakan dalam usaha mengejar kelebihan kuantum, termasuk penindasan ralat kuantum, mitigasi, pengesanan, dan pembetulan. Setiap kaedah diterangkan secara teori, kemudian dipraktikkan menggunakan Qiskit. Kami membincangkan kaedah mana yang berguna dalam senario yang mana, serta trend umum dalam kebolehgunaannya. Semasa kursus ini berkembang, kami memberi perhatian khusus kepada alat mana yang boleh digunakan bersama, dan mana yang bercanggah.\n"

